results/E1b/checks/smoke/**/*.csv

# Shared RunPod reservation state (docs/experiments/shared/runpod-reservations.md); live, never committed
logs/runpod_reservations.jsonl
logs/runpod_reservations.jsonl.lock
logs/e3_watchdog.pid
logs/E3-orchestrate.lock

# E3 (as E1b): large generated and judged CSVs stay local; their sha256 manifests are committed
results/E3/gen/
